# Runtime brain/memory state — regenerated by the sidecar, not source.
# NOTE: comments must sit on their own line. A trailing "# ..." becomes part
# of the pattern and silently matches nothing (these rules were dead until
# they were rewritten — the venv was untracked-and-unignored as a result).
